  "name": "p7-synthetic-v1",
  "description": "FLEURS test speech in 9 languages under VRChat-like conditions: clean; world / game music bleed, effects bleed and same-language babble at 20 / 10 / 5 dB; foreign babble at 10 dB; a light room; a band-limited codec-like mic; and a composite desk-speaker streamer mix.",
